{{ yesterday_ts | date: '%A, %B %d, %Y' }}</div>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}</div></div><div data-rid="ef2f5829-d536-4ca8-9ab7-8bee5a348c58" class="r-soo0ez"><div data-rid="074dfe53-b78c-4ec6-93ac-8e5cec2b149f" class="r-1uxahtw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Published on: Jan 27 2026</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6ca0235f-24b7-4bda-b4f3-1ab95fa93481" class="r-18y5x54"><div data-rid="5732cca6-b168-4c84-a3f3-ddceb4798783" class="r-ko24il"><picture data-rid="21fa9de9-05dd-4f31-a9a4-0b32a26818e0" data-loading="eager" data-fetchpriority="high" class="r-1obz7ts"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/406149da-4379-4a9c-8f0e-ef881b70af53?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/406149da-4379-4a9c-8f0e-ef881b70af53?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/406149da-4379-4a9c-8f0e-ef881b70af53?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/406149da-4379-4a9c-8f0e-ef881b70af53" alt="A surfer rides inside the barrel of a massive, curling blue ocean wave under a partly cloudy sky." class="r-5vti17" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="bb9b726f-dd7d-4098-92db-bdb69a6d2534" class="r-lwi1uc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Laird Hamilton, a 61-year-old surfer and entrepreneur, is doing something most men half his age can't: riding 40-foot walls of water at 30 miles per hour.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">And he’s been doing it for over four decades.</span></p><p><br></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Hamilton didn't just ride big waves—he changed how they're ridden.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">In the mid-1990s, he co-invented tow-in surfing, using motorized watercraft to two surfers into waves too massive to paddle into.</span></p><p><br></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Later, he pioneered hydrofoil surfing, attaching a hydrofoil to his surfboard.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">In 2000, he rode what's still considered one of the heaviest waves ever surfed—at Tahiti's Teahupoʻo.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">The moment made the cover of Surfer magazine with a single caption:</span></p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="9f6ae1e2-f80b-4607-9630-0d3a9a1f08fe" class="r-rmbyot"><div class="r-1ke6you" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="3ebe31d5-d355-4d1c-8265-2941f8992a20" class="r-6vvw6u"><div data-rid="110e39da-8f68-4e29-910c-e8e0acc1bafe" class="r-14aympd"><div data-rid="d7b0abdc-2dc1-4af4-a8e9-eb2139b51b2b" class="r-9gxpe2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>"oh my god..."</p></span></div><div data-rid="82d1d859-58be-4344-a2ab-190bfa70b9a5" class="r-1flq077 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">The physical toll of his surfing career? Brutal.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">A single big wave session can last three to five hours in frigid, churning water.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Dangerous waves dozens of feet high moving at 30 miles per hour. There’s no margin for error.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">You either perform at your peak, or the ocean eats you.</span></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">And at 61, Hamilton's body is still up to the task.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">How? Thanks to a “secret” most people have never heard.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">His secret to staying in the game isn't just about training harder—it's about fueling smarter.</span></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="7401c736-e29e-4942-991a-149f5bd5c744" class="r-uaq0yj"><picture data-rid="38c17f04-7ad1-49df-b5ea-707a58962d10" data-loading="lazy" class="r-yvi7b9"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d3a70c58-87f0-491b-98c1-f42e0d6aca1a/891f5373-2613-4ec6-8e69-82adeb5d0453?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/dc77b02a-3e38-49cd-9bd3-71996eafe5fa?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/dc77b02a-3e38-49cd-9bd3-71996eafe5fa?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/dc77b02a-3e38-49cd-9bd3-71996eafe5fa" class="r-1ef355c" loading="eager"/></picture></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="8a05fb74-ea43-4cde-b252-74d4cb693ded" class="r-jdr0ug"><div class="r-1qw8xml" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="6c762f2a-4280-49d3-b5a7-cf9afd311c55" class="r-aqn3er"><div data-rid="f56c271e-c9d6-40ab-a077-cb4934fbf2f6" class="r-99gc9t"><picture data-rid="3feb745c-f573-478c-badd-1dda41d60c9e" data-loading="lazy" class="r-prxe2d"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d3a70c58-87f0-491b-98c1-f42e0d6aca1a/1d6ea10e-0df0-4d90-b1a7-850efa4151c7?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/87c58b9d-3191-40dd-ab00-16ee9337b69a?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/87c58b9d-3191-40dd-ab00-16ee9337b69a?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/87c58b9d-3191-40dd-ab00-16ee9337b69a" class="r-e0ffo2" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="4a003cde-57bf-4ba9-950d-4d7f1f043a43" class="r-65zuuo"><div data-rid="469e9bfc-9140-4d1a-97b8-08218a19904a" class="r-1vn0ydh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>It All Started With His Morning Coffee</h2></span></div><div data-rid="1bef811c-c123-493f-948d-21efe1bcc1f5" class="r-2543ok alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Laird wanted to stay on the water longer—three, four, sometimes five hours riding massive swells.</span></h3></span></div><div data-rid="9e555aa9-c738-4fbe-a7b5-e09594475451" class="r-jwwnwa alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">But traditional coffee wasn't enough.</span></h3><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">The energy would fade, and he'd crash mid-session.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">He needed fuel that could last. So he started experimenting.</span></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">He began adding healthy plant-based fats to his morning cup.</span></h3><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Real-food ingredients.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Different combinations. Different ratios.</span></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Some worked. Most didn't.</span></h3><p><span><br></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">After years of trial and error, he perfected a recipe that did something traditional coffee never could.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4d4c929f-b992-495a-8aa1-8590199bd0dc" class="r-1ikza0d"><div data-rid="e73104da-0664-4364-9594-6a14d5ba6fe5" class="r-i2jahg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">But traditional coffee wasn't enough.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">The energy would fade, and he'd crash mid-session.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">He needed fuel that could last. So he started experimenting.</span></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">He began adding healthy plant-based fats to his morning cup.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Real-food ingredients.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Different combinations. Different ratios.</span></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Some worked. Most didn't.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">After years of trial and error, he perfected a recipe that did something traditional coffee never could.</span></p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="acc6e726-27e3-4d78-8e37-b3040565733c" class="r-keekck"><div class="r-16bddwp" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="9142e2d5-71d0-4b0b-8f2c-7e4d0e2716b9" class="r-133xqo2"><div data-rid="3f043b87-d7be-43e5-8df8-b931ce2bdd5e" class="r-6oyjxv"><div data-rid="095efc8c-b86c-4065-bfe2-ac0c30fbc781" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="offer" tabindex="-1" id="offer" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1wg3m0j"><div data-rid="aeb93631-452a-4509-97e3-feebc1d2132f" class="r-duyaic"><div data-rid="17dbf698-f5f1-4190-8877-dc91aa079db1" class="r-1t2vooe"><div data-rid="8fb43036-6f2b-49d2-b36a-c4eda585cee8" class="r-pqg3r1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>It Sustained His Energy for <em>Hours</em> on the Water</h2></span></div></div><div data-rid="bb20e513-1777-4e0f-80d3-0740ba89ce3a" class="r-1x3c9bl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">No jitters. No crash. No mid-afternoon fade.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">And the best part? It tasted incredible, too.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">But Laird couldn’t discover his fuel, if he didn’t test a lot of alternatives available in the market, first.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="3485b5f9-e2f4-43b6-894f-16c09bde16d0" class="r-t5zs5z alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3><strong>It didn’t take him </strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)"><strong>long to notice a common pattern with traditional coffee: For many people, the momentum fades faster than expected.</strong></span></h3></span></div><div data-rid="1e419208-abbf-455c-b13d-1a3c2f673f70" class="r-1wtlhxn alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">One moment it’s, "I can conquer the day" .. the next, it’s "I need a nap"</span></h3><p><br></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">For some, that means jitters</span></h3><p><br></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">For others, hunger.</span></h3><p><br></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Eventually, staying steady becomes a challenge.</span></h3></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="33b75349-8e6f-42ef-8869-128438383b15" class="r-8ver6s"><div data-rid="0eb4f68d-035f-4027-9d4f-82be3e0f9869" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="offer" tabindex="-1" id="offer" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1ojc3lw"><div data-rid="0afa6160-15b9-44fa-8b1e-47bffb5653cd" class="r-dongvv"><div data-rid="3e82ff6e-d396-4119-9d3b-87f5f41a3b2b" class="r-1e9vkqk"><div data-rid="ff69599a-16cc-43d1-bd3b-a6feb4796829" class="r-13ayzjz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>Laird's New Fuel Worked <em>Differently</em></h2></span></div></div><div data-rid="663a8835-b145-44c3-ba1e-3a2b58075373" class="r-apnmya alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">It was built on a slow-release formula.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Fast-digesting whey protein delivered immediate fuel.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Steady-release milk protein helped to power the entire day.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">He was no longer running on caffeine alone.</span></p><h3><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Instead, he was getting a sustained stream of amino acids.</span></h3><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">And he was enjoying energy throughout his long surfs.</span></p><p><br></p><p>A balanced, sustainable energy—not just caffeine.<br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Then there's the coffee itself.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="353bdeeb-6452-41de-9d8e-c89628dcb432" class="r-jjevgj"><div class="r-uoyyp6" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="f76462e7-c095-402a-9999-f72b1c8267b4" class="r-40nf7"><div data-rid="13b190b2-e36b-439b-b26b-83bd426491d3" class="r-oenlag"><div data-rid="aa6539d7-9392-4f8a-9c99-ed7df25c04a1" class="r-1blarwx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Laird used premium cold brew—about 140mg of caffeine with a smooth flavor and less acidity than traditional coffee.</span></p><h6><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">No bitter compounds. No harsh bite.</span></h6><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">And he added Lion's Mane mushroom for cognitive functionality… focus without the fog.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Laird knew he had to share his blend with friends and family.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">And they <em>loved</em> it.</span></p><h6><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">They felt the difference almost immediately.</span></h6><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">They noticed how they could focus more and how they could get more work done.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">And they asked him to share it with the world.</span></p><p><span><strong><br></strong></span></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="f5afb4a2-7e4b-4f56-88d5-c1f7e1cd344c" class="r-1x48yl2"><picture data-rid="98a5f252-946e-4b8f-814e-fe798daedc7a" data-loading="lazy" class="r-y1xfk7"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/36ac6e17-2cd8-4ff5-96ae-ed80d7fb4685?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/ae734ca9-0f0e-4af4-861f-4ea34ea47cfd?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66